title: A file with unsaved text that another program changes is not overwritten silently by save: the app asks, and Take theirs leaves what the other wrote and nothing unsaved
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
forbid-log: WARN.*script
expect-file: edit-odd/a.txt :: (?-i)THEIRS

wait 3000
goto a.txt
wait 800
edit a.txt 1 1
type MINE
touch a.txt THEIRS
wait 2500
mark both-changed
wait 400
key save
wait 800
mark asked-which-one
wait 400
answer Take theirs
wait 1200
mark theirs-on-the-card
wait 400
quit
